# Licel — App Security and Protection
> Licel provides powerful app security products that protect mobile apps, SDKs, and Java applications against reverse engineering, tampering, and fraud. EMVCo evaluated and approved.

## Products

### [DexProtector](https://licelus.com/products/dexprotector)
EMVCo-evaluated protection for Android and iOS apps and SDKs against reverse engineering, tampering, malware, and runtime attacks. Combines static and dynamic app protection (code hardening, integrity control, RASP, network hardening) with fraud and abuse defenses — Mobile API Protection, Anti-Malware, eKYC fraud prevention, and Data Leakage Prevention. Applied after the build as a pipeline step, on your own infrastructure. 12 billion+ protected app instances; deployed in 75+ countries since 2011.

### [Alice Threat Intelligence](https://licelus.com/products/alice-threat-intelligence)
Mobile app telemetry solution that provides trusted signals about what is happening on end user devices, enabling smarter security decisions.

### [vTEE](https://licelus.com/products/vtee)
Virtual Trusted Execution Environment for sensitive mobile operations. Provides a secure execution environment where trusted applications can perform sensitive transactions and operations. EMVCo evaluated for SBMP TEE.

### [CryptoModule](https://licelus.com/products/dexprotector/cryptomodule)
White-box cryptography solution for securing keys and tokens. Ideal for e-wallets, SoftPOS, and digital identity applications.

### [Stringer Java Obfuscator](https://licelus.com/products/stringer-java-obfuscator)
Java application security solution that stops tampering, reverse engineering, and other sophisticated attacks through advanced obfuscation.

### [JCardSim](https://licelus.com/products/jcardsim)
Open-source Java Card simulator for development and testing of Java Card applets — faster and more effective than physical card testing.

